---
import ResponsiveImage from "../ResponsiveImage.astro";
---
<section class="hero editorial-hero" id="home">
  <div class="ed-container ed-hero-grid">
    <div class="ed-hero-copy">
      <p class="ed-kicker"><span class="ed-dot"></span> 麻麻抱我 · 一份来自我的小小心愿</p>
      <h1>把我留在<br />每一段<span class="ed-title-accent">回忆</span>里<span class="ed-period">。</span></h1>
      <p class="ed-hero-promise">让我的陪伴，不止今天。</p>
      <p class="ed-hero-description">我陪你度过的平常一天，也值得被好好记住。<br class="ed-desktop-break" />从手机里的照片开始，打开小程序，<br class="ed-desktop-break" />把我最可爱的样子留下。</p>
      <div class="ed-hero-actions">
        <a class="ed-button" href="#contact">留下我的可爱 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="ed-text-link" href="#works">先逛逛作品集 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="ed-hero-signature">
        <div class="ed-avatars">
          <ResponsiveImage src="/assets/hero-shiba.jpg" alt="" width={1200} height={1200} sizes="40px" loading="eager" />
          <ResponsiveImage src="/assets/hero-devon.jpg" alt="" width={1200} height={1200} sizes="40px" loading="eager" />
          <ResponsiveImage src="/assets/hero-shepherd.jpg" alt="" width={1200} height={1200} sizes="40px" loading="eager" />
        </div>
        <span>每一种可爱，都有自己的主角时刻。</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="ed-hero-art">
      <div class="ed-hero-photo">
        <ResponsiveImage src="/assets/hero-editorial.jpg" alt="粉蓝光影里，一只蓝眼睛布偶猫趴在奶油黄色台座上看向你" width={1440} height={1800} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, 46vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <span class="ed-photo-label">THE LITTLE MUSE / 001</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ed-love-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>今天的我，<br />也要好好收藏。</p></div>
      <figcaption><span>把平常一天，变成珍藏。</span><span>AI 创意示例</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <div class="ed-container ed-hero-footer"><span>A LITTLE LOVE, KEPT FOREVER.</span><a href="#plays">往下看看我的可能 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</section>
